{
  "records": [
    {
      "id": "U-task",
      "author": "user",
      "status": "current",
      "text": "Buy an indivisible package consisting of six prepaid itinerary services numbered 0 through 5 and insurance, with the premium already included in price. Only one catalog row can be selected and fixed today; the package cannot be changed afterward according to the adverse event. The products, dates, suppliers, and availability have been checked accurately."
    },
    {
      "id": "U-events",
      "author": "user",
      "status": "current",
      "text": "There may be no adverse event, or any set of at most 4 services may be cancelled; every specific subset satisfying the count limit may occur. There are no additional correlation restrictions, and no probabilities are provided."
    },
    {
      "id": "U-contract",
      "author": "user",
      "status": "current",
      "text": "The sum of loss for the services actually cancelled is the gross loss. First subtract the whole-order deductible from the gross loss; if it is not exceeded, the payout is 0. The insurance covers 50% of the excess, then the payout is capped at coverage. This pays half of the excess, rather than the user paying only half of the deductible. All loss and deductible amounts are even numbers of fen of RMB, so no monetary rounding is needed. Net loss equals gross loss minus the actual insurance payout, plus one admin charge; admin is not covered by any insurance. The assessed loss for the empty event is 0, with no admin or other charges. Unaffected items incur no adverse-event loss; there are no other unstated terms."
    },
    {
      "id": "U-budget",
      "author": "user",
      "status": "current",
      "text": "The attributes are complete and accurate, and are all nonnegative integers; monetary amounts are in fen of RMB, and weight is in grams. The original payment price must not exceed 1200000 fen of RMB, and the original payment and discount conditions stated in the contract must be satisfied. In each permitted event, the assessment amount described above must not exceed 200000 fen of RMB; equality with the limit is acceptable, and the limit must not be relaxed. This catalog is complete, with no hidden options."
    },
    {
      "id": "U-utility",
      "author": "user",
      "status": "current",
      "text": "Utility in each event is 2000000 minus price, then minus the assessment amount for that event. For candidates that satisfy the hard conditions and risk limits for all events simultaneously, take the lowest utility over all events, then choose the candidate with the greatest lowest utility; accept only if that value is strictly greater than 0, otherwise refuse. Do not ask the user questions."
    }
  ],
